  <item>
    <title>vol.115 你管这叫零食？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6afda29ffe62f8f52c4d33f8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6afda29ffe62f8f52c4d33f8</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 13:23:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>（ 加听友群、投稿请备注听友加微信:K930630- )</span></p><ul><li><p><span>主播/ 润杰 Double 小黑 翘</span></p></li><li><p><span>音频后期/ 润杰 音频上传/ 润杰</span></p></li><li><p><span>封面设计/ 润杰</span></p></li></ul><p><span>Snacky Poo - Limp Bizkit</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开场：今天聊点让嘴停不下来的</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="272">04:32</a> 嗑瓜子这件事，一开始就很难结束</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="586">09:46</a> 鸭舌也有白月光：解馋还得有点讲究</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="884">14:44</a> 寻找更“解恨”的那一口鸭舌</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1061">17:41</a> 衢州鸭掌：临走还得打包一份</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1278">21:18</a> 鸡爪的快乐，在于慢慢啃</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1374">22:54</a> 润杰的独家吃法，听完先别急着学</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1531">25:31</a> 等等，猪蹄怎么也算零食？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1827">30:27</a> 猪肝、大蒜和薯片，能碰出什么味道？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2056">34:16</a> 牛肉脆片：从扎嘴到惊艳</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2331">38:51</a> 蘸酱菜，也能吃出零食的仪式感</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2876">47:56</a> 泰国零食巡礼：花生、海苔和奇怪口味的薯片</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2998">49:58</a> 臭豆腐面包，究竟能有多上头？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3134">52:14</a> 零食的边界，怎么聊到保健品了？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3411">56:51</a> 麦乳精、秋梨膏，还有小时候乱吃的那些东西</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3705">01:01:45</a> 童年误食实录：什么都敢往嘴里放</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4019">01:06:59</a> 昆虫和虾干，你的接受范围到哪儿？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4157">01:09:17</a> 辣条、大大卷：小区里的“零食富翁”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4344">01:12:24</a> 有没有一种零食，第一口就把你惊艳了？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4581">01:16:21</a> 把能量棒当零嘴，事情逐渐不对劲</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4755">01:19:15</a> 运动会和春秋游，才是零食的主场</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5187">01:26:27</a> 为了赠品买零食，谁还在乎吃的是什么</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5385">01:29:45</a> 校门口的冰汽水，和小孩独有的吃法</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5535">01:32:15</a> 评论区交作业：说说你最推荐的零食</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
