  <item>
    <title>vol.114 特别难受12</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6af70af53caef3b52f5551f4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6af70af53caef3b52f5551f4</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 13:17:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>（ 加听友群、投稿请备注听友加微信:K930630- )</span></p><ul><li><p><span>主播/ 润杰 Double 小黑 翘</span></p></li><li><p><span>音频后期/ 润杰 音频上传/ 润杰</span></p></li><li><p><span>封面设计/ 润杰</span></p></li><li><p><span>Skibidi - Little Big</span></p></li><li><p><span>I Fell so Bad - Chuck Willis</span></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">01:14</a> “特别难受”十二弹：攒够了，必须录一期</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="267">04:27</a> 改车一时爽，后续全是烦心事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="858">14:18</a> 修个摩托车，错过整个骑行季</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 高高兴兴去取车，老板却欲言又止</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1263">21:03</a> 朋友忙着修行，我们困在洗脑神曲里</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1475">24:35</a> 燕郊夜游：计划挺丰满，现场很难办</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1891">31:31</a> 夜游第二站：一场配合稀碎的“探险”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2274">37:54</a> 一场赌约，引出一段听着都疼的经历</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2646">44:06</a> 坐上高铁，怎么越睡越不对劲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2770">46:10</a> 拿着邀请函，还得证明“我就是我”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3355">55:55</a> 怕兄弟吃苦，又怕兄弟开路虎</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3651">01:00:51</a> 前老板的近况，这操作实在想不通</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3869">01:04:29</a> 演出场外风波：一场越吵越离谱的争执</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4575">01:16:15</a> 学生时代，那位谁都怕的德育主任</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4749">01:19:09</a> 熬夜追番：期待有多高，看完就有多难受</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5209">01:26:49</a> 半夜看4D恐怖片，刺激来得太具体</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5557">01:32:37</a> 保洁阿姨来早了，一场猝不及防的尴尬</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5828">01:37:08</a> 看直播看到着急：这话到底该怎么接</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5946">01:39:06</a> 听友投稿：优渥生活背后，一个意外的身世故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6388">01:46:28</a> 听友投稿：那个难熬的晚自习</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6707">01:51:47</a> 那些身体比脑子先做决定的瞬间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7118">01:58:38</a> 外服游戏里的中文，怎么越听越耳熟</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6796d26320899af1ba825517/lj6MkibVJ4cEusOKZJqlEhAqe1PC.m4a" length="122538168" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>02:06:09</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqs0HvGUq9JI-7O53NzpfigpDtQz.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.113 地摊时报6</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aeee008b4a4e20202f621e0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aeee008b4a4e20202f621e0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 08:31:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>（ 加听友群、投稿请备注听友加微信:K930630- )</span></p><ul><li><p><span>主播/ 润杰 Double 率夫 翘</span></p></li><li><p><span>音频后期/ 润杰 音频上传/ 润杰</span></p></li><li><p><span>封面设计/ 润杰</span></p></li><li><p><span>Happy Song - Boney M.</span></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">02:28</a> 手搓古罗马遗迹，这门生意能做多久？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="329">05:29</a> 艺术生再就业，方向比想象中更广</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="544">09:04</a> 当AI开始“焚书”，知识会属于谁？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="688">11:28</a> 电子宠物进化了：能替你上网，也能替你闯祸</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="869">14:29</a> 遇事不决找猴哥，五指山下也有烦恼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1023">17:03</a> 带资进组的吻戏，男主角有苦难言</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 一场只赚一毛钱的直播，代价有多大？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1511">25:11</a> 三十七岁装成小女孩，现实比电影更离谱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1979">32:59</a> 网约车司机的一程惊魂：这单加钱也不等</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2199">36:39</a> 网速太慢怎么办？印度村民有自己的办法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2352">39:12</a> 一口口水引发的意外，高压线旁别乱来</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2467">41:07</a> 万能的义乌，连飞碟都能安排上了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2623">43:43</a> 给鸡配上移动单间，自由了，但没完全自由</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2749">45:49</a> 大鹅的社交生活，比你想象中丰富</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2849">47:29</a> 遭遇鲨鱼之后，一场巧合接力的生死救援</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3040">50:40</a> 从替女友挂号到收费抢号，程序员越过了哪条线？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3129">52:09</a> 当同学开始调查你的家境，校园霸凌有了新方式</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3332">55:32</a> 孩子刷到了什么？短视频里的未成年保护难题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">59:00</a> 孩子放不下手机，家长能不能先放下指责？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3789">01:03:09</a> 用AI对付AI，让骗子也尝尝被消耗的滋味</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3928">01:05:28</a> 钓鱼还是碰运气？鱼塘里的玩法越来越看不懂</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4170">01:09:30</a> 一张自拍惹出祸：出门在外，手势别乱比</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4420">01:13:40</a> 忍耐有次数，离职有“赠礼”：老板也得小心了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4723">01:18:43</a> 收摊，下期聊聊那些特别难受的事</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6796d26320899af1ba825517/lmUiUcQMgXl3tLN58NxHS4wkDyPg.m4a" length="77936257" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:20:14</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl1W67pMwtxoGD41291q-XJItC--.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.112 狗改不了喝酒3</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ae5c3be97726cd4675a9700</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ae5c3be97726cd4675a9700</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 10:39:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>（ 加听友群、投稿请备注听友加微信:K930630- )</span></p><ul><li><p><span>主播/ 润杰 Double 率夫 翘</span></p></li><li><p><span>音频后期/ 润杰 音频上传/ 润杰</span></p></li><li><p><span>封面设计/ 润杰</span></p></li></ul><p><span>Disconnected - James Hype</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">04:05</a> 雨天的一场酒，怎么一路喝到了天亮</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="691">11:31</a> 第一次喝酒：难喝是真的，好奇也是真的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1097">18:17</a> 东北童年往事：电视剧里的酒，现实里能喝吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1502">25:02</a> 帅夫的酒桌初体验：六个新手，谁也不肯露怯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1936">32:16</a> 有人越喝越嗨，有人越喝越安静</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2305">38:25</a> 酒后的留人模式：今晚谁也不许走</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2757">45:57</a> 成都之夜：记忆从哪一杯开始消失？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2995">49:55</a> 不喝酒的人，也能成为舞池主角</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3278">54:38</a> 蹦迪累了，千万别随便找地方躺</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3608">01:00:08</a> SCHOOL往事：那些第二天才知道的自己</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3742">01:02:22</a> 除夕夜的酒局，一场不太好聊的谈心</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3923">01:05:23</a> “来都来了”：一场硬着头皮赴的约</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4408">01:13:28</a> 巡演之后，这场酒怎么还没结束？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4816">01:20:16</a> 当喝酒变成了醒来就继续</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5132">01:25:32</a> 宿醉之后，大家都是怎么熬过来的？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5416">01:30:16</a> 为了一件衣服，这回又喝到了什么程度？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5508">01:31:48</a> 酒后失态见闻：场面逐渐失去控制</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5814">01:36:54</a> 当妹妹决定测试一下自己的酒量</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6120">01:42:00</a> 工作室酒局：劝酒的时候，谁也没想到后来</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6276">01:44:36</a> 酒后寻物记：手机到底掉在哪儿了？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6441">01:47:21</a> 从现实聊到《宿醉》：这些故事，下回还能接着讲</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
