  <item>
    <title>vol.111 人生巅峰不常有，丢人倒是忘不了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ada71e3c96c8942ec10d557</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ada71e3c96c8942ec10d557</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:42:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>（ 加听友群、投稿请备注听友加微信:K930630- )</span></p><ul><li><p><span>主播/ 润杰 Double 小黑 诚宇</span></p></li><li><p><span>音频后期/ 润杰 音频上传/ 润杰</span></p></li><li><p><span>封面设计/ 润杰</span></p></li></ul><p><span>Don't Sweat The Technique - Eric B. &amp; Rakim</span></p><p><span>Jerk It Out - Caesars</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="116">01:56</a> 今天聊聊人生的高光时刻</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="484">08:04</a> 一场迟来的校园音乐节</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="974">16:14</a> 艺考那年，我离央美有多近</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1473">24:33</a> 从普通玩家到全国赛场</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1852">30:52</a> 玩乐队，什么时刻最值得纪念？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">31:50</a> 那些让人印象深刻的玄学反馈</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2115">35:15</a> 把一场演出带进大山</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2750">45:50</a> 被自己欣赏的人认可</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2892">48:12</a> 高光时刻，怎么变成了高空时刻？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3050">50:50</a> 第一次独立操盘大型演唱会</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3272">54:32</a> 黑哥的饭桌，也有高光时刻</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3578">59:38</a> 话锋一转，开始聊聊丢人的事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3838">01:03:58</a> 考试，是我至今没醒的噩梦</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4159">01:09:19</a> 小时候那些挨揍的往事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4262">01:11:02</a> 小学英语汇演，至今不敢细想</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4424">01:13:44</a> 我的中队长生涯</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4801">01:20:01</a> 大学期末考试的奇妙操作</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5195">01:26:35</a> 第一次走进正规纹身工作室</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5354">01:29:14</a> 一场难忘的线上毕业答辩</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5720">01:35:20</a> 成年当天，直奔网吧</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5778">01:36:18</a> 台上救场的三分钟，怎么这么长</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5871">01:37:51</a> 演出后台，说话也得小心</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6012">01:40:12</a> 朋友圈里的意外碰面</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6092">01:41:32</a> 那些让电台人不敢回首的往事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6442">01:47:22</a> 那天晚上，我们聊得特别走心</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6727">01:52:07</a> 节目预告与告别</span></p>]]></description>
