    <title>vol.110 不好意思，你已经冒犯到我了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ad226780e4e410a05bdf619</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ad226780e4e410a05bdf619</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 13:36:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>（ 加听友群、投稿请备注听友加微信:K930630- )</span></p><ul><li><p><span>主播/ 润杰 率夫 翘 Double</span></p></li><li><p><span>音频后期/ 润杰 音频上传/ 润杰</span></p></li><li><p><span>封面设计/ 润杰</span></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a> 欢迎收听，一场从外号开始的礼貌讨论</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="232">03:52</a> 嘴上不干净，和没礼貌是一回事吗？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="351">05:51</a> 从听友反馈说起：能不能先让人把话说完</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">09:16</a> 见面不打招呼，是社恐还是不懂礼貌？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="806">13:26</a> 年龄差了十几岁，还能不能聊到一起？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="976">16:16</a> 从学生时代聊起：尊重是怎么学会的？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1219">20:19</a> 一段母女对话里的尊重与不尊重</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1470">24:30</a> 家教、天性与环境，谁在塑造一个人？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1604">26:44</a> 亲戚家的孩子，怎么越来越陌生了？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1867">31:07</a> 游戏语音里的小孩，精神世界有多丰富</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1987">33:07</a> 两个孩子，两种截然不同的相处方式</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2089">34:49</a> 喝酒前后，礼貌也能判若两人</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2283">38:03</a> 离开家以后，身边的朋友教会了我们什么</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2469">41:09</a> 初来北京：不敢说话，也不敢伸手夹菜</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2560">42:40</a> 那些年，关于点烟的“礼仪课”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2652">44:12</a> 一条记了很多年的朋友圈评论</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2877">47:57</a> 有些社会经验，学起来确实有点疼</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3005">50:05</a> 北京人的“您”，到底有多少种意思？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3132">52:12</a> “怎么办”：被别人的坏情绪困住</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3507">58:27</a> 合租往事：天一黑，熟悉的问题又来了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3650">01:00:50</a> 当一个人的“关心”开始让你害怕</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3857">01:04:17</a> 难过的时候，我们怎么向朋友求助？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4017">01:06:57</a> 让人舒服的人，相处起来是什么样？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4218">01:10:18</a> 总在你面前说别人坏话的人</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4358">01:12:38</a> 看别人画画，也得有点边界感</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4454">01:14:14</a> 关系再好，是不是也该留一点距离？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4661">01:17:41</a> 录播客以后，重新学习怎么接话</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4811">01:20:11</a> 意见不一样，也可以把话聊下去</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5019">01:23:39</a> 预约、定金与那些让纹身师头疼的客人</span></p>]]></description>
