data-timestamp="3819">01:03:39</a> 回到2012：你是怎么等世界末日的？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3961">01:06:01</a> 梦里的事，为什么会在现实里重演？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4313">01:11:53</a> 如果时间可以铺开，人生会是什么样？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4447">01:14:07</a> 死藤水与意识体验：那些奇异的讲述</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4939">01:22:19</a> 从《遁入虚无》到《超感猎杀》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5330">01:28:50</a> 念力、仪式与辟谷：越聊越远的神秘世界</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
